# Blackmagic DeckLink SDK is not redistributable. Each developer downloads
# it from blackmagicdesign.com/support and runs build/download-decklink-sdk.sh
# to populate electron/native/decklink-output/include/. The README.md in
# that folder is committed; everything else there is generated.
electron/native/decklink-output/include/*.h
electron/native/decklink-output/include/*.cpp
electron/native/decklink-output/include/*.rtf
electron/native/decklink-output/build/
